# ============================================================
# .gitignore for structure-negative-steering
# ============================================================

# ----- Experiments — results are HPC-only, test DEFINITIONS are tracked -----
# The experiments/ tree (prior runs migrated from the HPC scratch folder plus
# future run outputs) is local/HPC-only. The one exception that IS tracked is
# each benchmarking target's test spec, config.yml + the reference *.pdb.
# Derived inputs/ and run/ outputs stay ignored even under benchmarking/.
# Documentation lives in the root README.md, not in per-directory READMEs.
# The tree is experiments/benchmarking/<unconstrained|constrained>/<TARGET>/.
experiments/*
!experiments/benchmarking/
experiments/benchmarking/*
!experiments/benchmarking/*/
experiments/benchmarking/*/*
!experiments/benchmarking/*/*/
experiments/benchmarking/*/*/*
!experiments/benchmarking/*/*/config.yml
!experiments/benchmarking/*/*/*.pdb

# ----- Nextflow -----
.nextflow/
.nextflow.log*
.nextflow.history*
work/

# ----- Pipeline-style outputs -----
*_results/
results/

# ----- SLURM logs -----
*.out
*.err
slurm-*.out
slurm-*.err

# ----- Python -----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ----- Jupyter -----
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ----- macOS -----
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# ----- Microsoft Office lock files -----
~$*

# ----- Editors / IDEs / agents -----
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ----- Environment / secrets -----
.env
.env.local
*.local

# ----- Smoke-run outputs. The config is tracked, the run is not -----
tests/smoke/run/
tests/smoke/run_cli/
tests/smoke/.cli_view*
tests/smoke/inputs/
tests/smoke/*.out
tests/smoke/*.err

# ----- Coverage artefacts, regenerated by any test run -----
htmlcov/
lcov.info
.coverage

# ----- Build / packaging -----
build/
dist/
*.egg
.eggs/

# ----- Singularity / Apptainer images -----
*.img
*.sif

# ----- Sync helper artefacts -----
rsync_dryrun*.txt
rsync_deletions*.txt

# ----- Quarto render artifacts (figures/ PNGs+SVGs are committed separately) -----
*_files/
analysis/**/*.html

# ----- Nextflow run reports, regenerated on every run -----
trace.txt
report.html
timeline.html

# ----- Working notes, local only -----
notes/repo-cleanup-playbook.md

# ----- OS / misc -----
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
